{"page":538,"width":1665,"height":2536,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"600","words":[{"text":"600","x":167,"y":144,"width":56,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 13 파일 시스템 인터페이스","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":293,"y":148,"width":114,"height":28},{"text":"13","x":420,"y":150,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"파일","x":483,"y":150,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":532,"y":150,"width":63,"height":26},{"text":"인터페이스","x":604,"y":152,"width":105,"height":24}]},{"text":"들어, 특정 프로젝트에 시용되는 프로그램은 모든 프로그램의 디렉터 리와 그 프로젝트의","words":[{"text":"들어,","x":293,"y":271,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"특정","x":374,"y":272,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"프로젝트에","x":446,"y":273,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"시용되는","x":604,"y":272,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램은","x":732,"y":274,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":894,"y":277,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"프로그램의","x":967,"y":274,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터","x":1137,"y":275,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"리와","x":1236,"y":274,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"그","x":1310,"y":278,"width":33,"height":24},{"text":"프로젝트의","x":1355,"y":275,"width":156,"height":37}]},{"text":"디렉터리 모두에 존재해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"디렉터리","x":294,"y":328,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"모두에","x":425,"y":330,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"존재해야","x":525,"y":330,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":653,"y":330,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"공유 파일(공유 디렉터리)은 여러 가지 방법으로 구현한다. 일반적인 방법(UNIX에","words":[{"text":"공유","x":348,"y":387,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"파일(공유","x":422,"y":387,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"디렉터리)은","x":565,"y":387,"width":158,"height":38},{"text":"여러","x":736,"y":387,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":807,"y":387,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"방법으로","x":879,"y":388,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"구현한다.","x":1014,"y":388,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"일반적인","x":1166,"y":388,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"방법(UNIX에","x":1309,"y":387,"width":202,"height":37}]},{"text":"서 사용)은 링크(link)라 불리는 새로운 디렉터리 항목을 만드는 것으로 링크는 다른 파","words":[{"text":"서","x":292,"y":443,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"사용)은","x":333,"y":444,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"링크(link)라","x":449,"y":444,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"불리는","x":630,"y":445,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":731,"y":445,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":833,"y":445,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":967,"y":445,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"만드는","x":1073,"y":445,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"것으로","x":1184,"y":445,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"링크는","x":1298,"y":444,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":1408,"y":445,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"파","x":1483,"y":448,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"일이나 서브디렉터리를 가리기는 포인터이다. 이러한 링크는 절대 혹은, 상대 경로명으","words":[{"text":"일이나","x":291,"y":501,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"서브디렉터리를","x":395,"y":502,"width":209,"height":35},{"text":"가리기는","x":617,"y":502,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"포인터이다.","x":747,"y":502,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":921,"y":502,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"링크는","x":1029,"y":502,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"절대","x":1138,"y":502,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"혹은,","x":1216,"y":502,"width":74,"height":35},{"text":"상대","x":1306,"y":501,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"경로명으","x":1388,"y":502,"width":126,"height":36}]},{"text":"로 구현될 수 있다. 파일에 대한 참조가 일어날 때, 디렉터리를 검색한다. 만약 디렉터리","words":[{"text":"로","x":289,"y":562,"width":31,"height":26},{"text":"구현될","x":332,"y":559,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":434,"y":560,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":477,"y":560,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"파일에","x":554,"y":560,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":655,"y":560,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"참조가","x":725,"y":560,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"일어날","x":828,"y":560,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"때,","x":931,"y":560,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리를","x":983,"y":560,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"검색한다.","x":1154,"y":560,"width":138,"height":34},{"text":"만약","x":1308,"y":560,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1389,"y":560,"width":121,"height":37}]},{"text":"항목이 링크로 표시되어 있다면, 실제 파일 이름은 링크 정보에 포함되어 있다. 실제 파","words":[{"text":"항목이","x":289,"y":616,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"링크로","x":394,"y":617,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"표시되어","x":495,"y":618,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"있다면,","x":626,"y":617,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"실제","x":736,"y":617,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":806,"y":617,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"이름은","x":880,"y":617,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"링크","x":986,"y":618,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"정보에","x":1062,"y":617,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"포함되어","x":1170,"y":617,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1319,"y":617,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"실제","x":1408,"y":618,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"파","x":1483,"y":621,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"일에 대한 경로 이름을 시용함으로써 우리는 링크를 해석(resolve)한다. 링크는 디렉터","words":[{"text":"일에","x":290,"y":674,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":363,"y":675,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"경로","x":436,"y":675,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"이름을","x":508,"y":675,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"시용함으로써","x":608,"y":675,"width":175,"height":35},{"text":"우리는","x":798,"y":675,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"링크를","x":904,"y":676,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"해석(resolve)한다.","x":1009,"y":675,"width":279,"height":39},{"text":"링크는","x":1308,"y":676,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터","x":1421,"y":677,"width":88,"height":35}]},{"text":"리 항목9(또는 유형을 지원하는 시스템에서는 특별한 유형을 가질 수도 있다)의 형식을","words":[{"text":"리","x":289,"y":732,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"항목9(또는","x":333,"y":733,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"유형을","x":478,"y":734,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"지원하는","x":582,"y":733,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"시스템에서는","x":714,"y":733,"width":181,"height":35},{"text":"특별한","x":908,"y":734,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"유형을","x":1016,"y":734,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"가질","x":1128,"y":734,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"수도","x":1208,"y":736,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"있다)의","x":1294,"y":734,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"형식을","x":1421,"y":735,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"통해서 쉽게 구분될 수 있고 간접적 포인터로 지칭된다. 운영체제가 디렉터리 트리를 순","words":[{"text":"통해서","x":287,"y":791,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"쉽게","x":391,"y":792,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"구분될","x":460,"y":792,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":560,"y":793,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있고","x":603,"y":792,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"간접적","x":672,"y":791,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"포인터로","x":772,"y":792,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"지칭된다.","x":906,"y":792,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제가","x":1050,"y":792,"width":166,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1229,"y":793,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"트리를","x":1374,"y":793,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"순","x":1483,"y":795,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"회할 때는 시스템의 비순환 구조를 유지하기 위해 이들 링크를 무시한다.","words":[{"text":"회할","x":288,"y":849,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"때는","x":359,"y":850,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"시스템의","x":430,"y":849,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"비순환","x":559,"y":849,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"구조를","x":656,"y":851,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"유지하기","x":756,"y":849,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":890,"y":850,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"이들","x":962,"y":850,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"링크를","x":1036,"y":850,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"무시한다.","x":1142,"y":851,"width":141,"height":35}]},{"text":"파일을 공유하는 또 다른 방법은 (그것을 공유하는) 디렉터리들이 동일한 항목 내용","words":[{"text":"파일을","x":343,"y":908,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"공유하는","x":444,"y":908,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"또","x":574,"y":912,"width":29,"height":26},{"text":"다른","x":615,"y":908,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"방법은","x":685,"y":907,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"(그것을","x":787,"y":908,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"공유하는)","x":901,"y":908,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"디렉터리들이","x":1052,"y":908,"width":191,"height":36},{"text":"동일한","x":1260,"y":909,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"항목","x":1374,"y":910,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"내용","x":1453,"y":910,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"을 복사해서 가지고 있는 방법이다. 두 개의 항목은 동일하고 같은 것이다. 이 방법과 링","words":[{"text":"을","x":285,"y":965,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"복사해서","x":327,"y":966,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"가지고","x":460,"y":966,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":560,"y":966,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"방법이다.","x":629,"y":966,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"두","x":768,"y":968,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"개의","x":810,"y":967,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"항목은","x":882,"y":967,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"동일하고","x":985,"y":966,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":1127,"y":967,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":1208,"y":967,"width":104,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":1329,"y":968,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"방법과","x":1374,"y":968,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"링","x":1485,"y":969,"width":24,"height":34}]},{"text":"크를 생성하는 방법과의 차이를 생각해 보자. 링크는 원래의 디렉터리외는 완연히 다른","words":[{"text":"크를","x":286,"y":1025,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"생성하는","x":360,"y":1024,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"방법과의","x":490,"y":1024,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"차이를","x":621,"y":1024,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"생각해","x":722,"y":1024,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"보자.","x":826,"y":1024,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"링크는","x":910,"y":1025,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"원래의","x":1015,"y":1024,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터리외는","x":1126,"y":1024,"width":199,"height":36},{"text":"완연히","x":1338,"y":1026,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":1452,"y":1026,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"것이므로 그 두 개는 같은 것이 아니다. 그러나 디렉터리 항목을 복사하는 것은 복사본","words":[{"text":"것이므로","x":288,"y":1082,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":418,"y":1088,"width":30,"height":23},{"text":"두","x":460,"y":1084,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"개는","x":504,"y":1083,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":576,"y":1083,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"것이","x":648,"y":1082,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"아니다.","x":720,"y":1082,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":832,"y":1082,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리","x":938,"y":1082,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":1077,"y":1082,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"복사하는","x":1188,"y":1083,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"것은","x":1339,"y":1083,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"복사본","x":1418,"y":1084,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"과 원래 것이 구분이 안 된다. 디렉터리 항목을 복사하는데 또 하나의 디렉터리를 변경","words":[{"text":"과","x":286,"y":1141,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"원래","x":330,"y":1141,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":404,"y":1141,"width":53,"height":35},{"text":"구분이","x":472,"y":1141,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"안","x":575,"y":1141,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"된다.","x":617,"y":1141,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":699,"y":1141,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"항목을","x":832,"y":1141,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"복사하는데","x":936,"y":1140,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"또","x":1108,"y":1144,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"하나의","x":1156,"y":1140,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리를","x":1272,"y":1141,"width":165,"height":35},{"text":"변경","x":1452,"y":1143,"width":55,"height":35}]},{"text":"하면 다른 동일한 복사본 항목도 함께 바뀌어야 하는 일관성(consistency) 문제가 발생","words":[{"text":"하면","x":286,"y":1199,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":358,"y":1200,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"동일한","x":427,"y":1199,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"복사본","x":526,"y":1199,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"항목도","x":627,"y":1200,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"함께","x":728,"y":1199,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"바뀌어야","x":801,"y":1199,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"하는","x":935,"y":1199,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"일관성(consistency)","x":1011,"y":1198,"width":312,"height":41},{"text":"문제가","x":1338,"y":1200,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"발생","x":1450,"y":1201,"width":57,"height":35}]},{"text":"한다.","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":286,"y":1257,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"비순환 그래프 디렉터리는 트리 구조보다는 융통성 있는 대신 더 복잡하다. 여러 문","words":[{"text":"비순환","x":344,"y":1315,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"그래프","x":441,"y":1316,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터리는","x":543,"y":1316,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"트리","x":702,"y":1316,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"구조보다는","x":774,"y":1316,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"융통성","x":939,"y":1314,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"있는","x":1048,"y":1314,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"대신","x":1124,"y":1314,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":1203,"y":1314,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"복잡하다.","x":1247,"y":1315,"width":141,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":1406,"y":1316,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"문","x":1479,"y":1319,"width":31,"height":32}]},{"text":"제들을 신중히 고려해야만 한다. 파일은 여러 개의 절대 경로명을 가질 수 있다. 결과적","words":[{"text":"제들을","x":288,"y":1374,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"신중히","x":389,"y":1373,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"고려해야만","x":488,"y":1374,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":648,"y":1374,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"파일은","x":729,"y":1374,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"여러","x":833,"y":1374,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"개의","x":907,"y":1373,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"절대","x":981,"y":1373,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"경로명을","x":1058,"y":1373,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"가질","x":1201,"y":1373,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1280,"y":1373,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1329,"y":1374,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"결과적","x":1418,"y":1374,"width":88,"height":36}]},{"text":"으로 다른 파일 이름이 같은 파일을 가리킬 수 있다. 이 문제는 프로그래밍 언어에서의","words":[{"text":"으로","x":286,"y":1434,"width":60,"height":27},{"text":"다른","x":359,"y":1432,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":430,"y":1432,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"이름이","x":503,"y":1432,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":604,"y":1432,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"파일을","x":676,"y":1432,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"가리킬","x":780,"y":1432,"widt